Presented an analysis of Indigenous kidney health using longitudinal linked health data. The presentation demonstrated how data from multiple health and administrative sources can be linked and analysed to identify patterns of kidney disease, risk factors, and opportunities for earlier intervention, while applying a strengths-based approach to interpreting health data.
